# Credentials for yasp-agent's `yasp-toolkit`, which the kernelgen and kernelgen evaluation
# steps run. yasp-toolkit reads this variable from the environment, so export it before
# running the check (for example `set -a; . ./.env; set +a`); nothing reads this file for you.
# Create a key at https://compile.yasp.ai/dashboard/tokens, or store one in the OS keyring
# instead with `yasp-toolkit keyring set` and leave the variable unset.
# This key stays on the host: no container the check runs receives it, and the check mints no key
# for the Gaia worker, which you deploy yourself (see README.md, "Deploy the Gaia worker").
# Installing yasp-agent and building the export image read the yasp package index with a registry
# key minted from this key (`yasp-toolkit registry key`), handed over as a temporary netrc file;
# the image build takes it as a BuildKit secret (see README.md) and the built image holds no key.
YASP_API_KEY=
